    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Main path (per partition)",
      "items": [
        "One process_date partition is read at a time, keeping memory bounded",
        "Order is dedup before validate (ADR-018), then an idempotent partition write",
        "Valid rows are stamped with row-level lineage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Fail-closed branches",
      "items": [
        "A breaking schema change fails the partition at the gate, nothing is curated",
        "Contract failures are quarantined with a per-row reason, the run continues",
        "A duplicate re-delivery is collapsed latest-wins, not quarantined"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Incremental state & evidence",
      "items": [
        "Watermark plus a 3-day window absorbs late arrivals",
        "Freshness exposes the as-of date CORA tells the customer",
